## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to diagnose multi-tenant routing issues with Istio, header propagation, and fast rollback.

## Key Concepts
- Istio routing: VirtualService, DestinationRule, mTLS
- Per-tenant headers, header-based routing
- Redis ACLs and per-tenant keys
- Canary rollouts and latency budgets

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: per-tenant routing rule sketch (illustrative)
const vs = {
  http: [{
    match: [{ headers: { 'x-tenant-id': { exact: 'tenantA' } } }],
    route: [{ destination: { host: 'api-tenantA' } }]
  }]
};
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you automate rollback with metrics thresholds?
- How would you extend to support dynamic tenant onboarding without restarts?
